silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_concrete_anchor_4#mittensbodymasslocalinfo silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensBodyMassLocalInfo is In section 'Manifest Verification and Provenance Gaps' the bare symbol VerifiedStatus anchors to MittensBodyMassLocalInfo: The interpreted claim extracted from the vet record: 'Mittens has a body mass of 4.2 kg recorded by Dr. Osei on 2024-03-15.' This is the paraphrase stripped of formatting artifacts; it states the Forge-relevant fact." .
